					</script></div><ul id="top" class="accessibleLinks"><li><a href="#content">Skip to main content</a></li><li><a href="#plainViewNav">Skip to navigation</a></li></ul><div id="layout1"><div id="header"><h2><img alt="Legislation.gov.uk" src="/images/chrome/plainViewHeaderTitle.gif" /></h2><a href="/asp/2005/13/contents">Back to full view</a></div><div id="background"></div><div id="layout2"><h1 id="pageTitle" class="pageTitle">Smoking, Health and Social Care (Scotland) Act 2005</h1><div class="interface" id="plainViewNav"></div><div id="content"><div id="viewLegContents" xml:lang="en"><div class="LegSnippet" id="tocControlsAdded"><div class="LegContents LegClearFix"><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/introduction">Introductory Text</a></span></p></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/1">Part 1 Smoking: prohibition and control</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/1">1.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/1">Offence of permitting others to smoke in no-smoking premises</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/2">2.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/2">Offence of smoking in no-smoking premises</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/3">3.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/3">Display of warning notices in and on no-smoking premises</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4">4.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4">Meaning of “smoke” and “no-smoking premises”</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4A">4A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4A">Offence of permitting others to smoke outside hospital building</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4B">4B.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4B">Offence of smoking outside hospital building</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4C">4C.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4C">Display of warning notices in hospital buildings and on hospital grounds</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4D">4D.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/4D">Meaning of “no-smoking area outside a hospital building” and related expressions</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/5">Proceedings for offences under sections 1 to 3 and 4A to 4C</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/6">Fixed penalties</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/7">7.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/7">Powers to enter and require identification</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/8">8.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/8">Bodies corporate etc.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/9">9.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/9">Sale of tobacco to under-age persons: variation of age limit</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/10">10.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/10">Crown application</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/2">Part 2 General dental services, general ophthalmic services, personal dental services <span xml:lang="la">etc.</span></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/11">11.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/11">Detection of vision problems in children</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/12">12.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/12">Free oral health assessments and dental examinations</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/13">13.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/13">Free eye examinations and sight tests</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/14">14.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/14">Charges for certain dental appliances and general dental services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/15">15.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/15">Arrangements for provision of general dental services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/16">16.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/16">Assistance and support: general dental services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/17">17.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/17">Lists of persons undertaking to provide or approved to assist in the provision of general dental services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/18">18.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/18">Lists of persons performing personal dental services under section 17C arrangements or pilot schemes</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/19">19.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/19">Lists of persons undertaking to provide or approved to assist in the provision of general ophthalmic services</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/3">Part 3 Pharmaceutical care services etc.</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/20">20.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/20">Health Boards' functions: provision and planning of pharmaceutical care services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/21">21.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/21">Pharmaceutical care services contracts</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/22">22.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/22">Drug Tariff</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/23">23.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/23">Persons performing pharmaceutical care services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/24">24.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/24">Assistance and support: primary medical services and pharmaceutical care services</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/4">Part 4 Provision of services under NHS contracts</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/25">25.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/25">Provision of certain services under NHS contracts</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/5">Part 5 Discipline</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/26">26.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/26">Disqualification by the NHS Tribunal</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/27">27.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/27">Corresponding provision in England or Wales or Northern Ireland</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6">Part 6 Miscellaneous</a></p><ol><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6/crossheading/infection-with-hepatitis-c-as-a-result-of-nhs-treatment-etc"><em>Infection with hepatitis C as a result of NHS treatment etc.</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/28">28.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/28">Payments to certain persons infected with hepatitis C as a result of NHS treatment etc.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6/crossheading/amendment-of-regulation-of-care-scotland-act-2001"><em>Amendment of Regulation of Care (Scotland) Act 2001</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/29">29.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/29">Independent health care services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/30">30.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/30">Implementation of certain decisions under the 2001 Act</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/31">31.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/31">Frequency of inspection of care services under the 2001 Act</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/32">32.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/32">Provision of information to the Scottish Social Services Council</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6/crossheading/child-care-agencies-and-housing-support-services"><em>Child care agencies and housing support services</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/33">33.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/33">Registration of child care agencies and housing support services</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/34">34.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/34">Grants in respect of housing support services</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6/crossheading/authorisation-of-medical-treatment"><em>Authorisation of medical treatment</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/35">35.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/35">Amendment of Adults with Incapacity (Scotland) Act 2000: authorisation of medical treatment</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6/crossheading/appeals-under-public-health-scotland-act-1897"><em>Appeals under Public Health (Scotland) Act 1897</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/36">36.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/36">Amendment of Public Health (Scotland) Act 1897: appeal against certain orders etc.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6/crossheading/joint-ventures"><em>Joint ventures</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/37">37.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/37">Joint ventures</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/6/crossheading/scottish-hospital-endowments-research-trust"><em>Scottish Hospital Endowments Research Trust</em></a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/38">38.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/38">Scottish Hospital Endowments Research Trust</a></span></p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/part/7">Part 7 General</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/39">39.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/39">Ancillary provision</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/40">40.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/40">Regulations or orders</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/41">41.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/41">Interpretation</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/42">42.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/42">Minor and consequential amendments and repeals</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/43">43.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/section/43">Short title and commencement</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsSchedules"><ol><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsSchedule tocDefaultCollapse"><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/asp/2005/13/schedule/1">SCHEDULE 1</a></p><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/asp/2005/13/schedule/1">Fixed penalty for offences under sections 1, 2, 3, 4A, 4B and 4C(5)</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><